"""GPU MMU operator scenario.

This portable scenario proves explicit arena handles, lease safety, bounded
staging, durable CAS recovery, deterministic planning, and honest optional
capability gates. Direct hardware absence remains `unsupported`. The Linux RSS
row is measured in isolated subprocesses; hosts without `/proc` do not pass it.
"""

# codex-system-test
# @req REQ-001 REQ-002 REQ-003 REQ-004 REQ-005 REQ-006 REQ-007 REQ-008 REQ-009
# @req NFR-001 NFR-002 NFR-003 NFR-004 NFR-005 NFR-006 NFR-007
use std.spec.*
